<%# What the two row colours mean: one question and its answer, rendered inside
    the page's About This Report list. Both pages say it the same way, about
    their own kind of row. %>
<dt>What do the row colors mean?</dt>
<dd>
  A red row means no one has signed up for the <%= subject %>. An amber row
  means it has people but less than
  <%= ShiftSignupsReport::LOW_FILL_PERCENTAGE %>% of its sign-ups are filled.
</dd>
